t_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":18,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I wrote `tasks/CAT-01/judge.md`. The verdict is **pass**, with no confirmed defects.\n\n- **Previous round:** the last verdict was also `pass` and found no defects, so nothing needed marking fixed or withdrawn. After it, the adopt gate still failed on `break-proof`: it reported that all four integration tests stay green when their break is applied. The test stage then ran again and changed no file.\n- **The gate failure isn't explained by the tests.** I checked each break patch against the current source it changes, and each one matches it line for line. Under each break, the test should fail on one of its own assertions:\n  - The reversed name order fails the sorted-order check (line 61).\n  - The empty description fails the description check (line 75).\n  - The shortened \"View\" link label fails the label check (line 89).\n  - The changed heading fails the heading check (line 109).\n\n  I logged this in the judge file as a suspicion, not a confirmed defect. The likely cause is the break patches themselves: they were written by hand and nobody has checked that they apply with `git apply --check`. This session wasn't allowed to run that check either.\n- **All five criteria** are covered by tests that set up the scenario, open the page and assert every expected outcome with the story's values.\n\n**Decision for you:** the gate will likely fail `break-proof` again as things stand, and the gate status shows round 2 of at most 3. To settle it, run `git apply --check tasks/CAT-01/breaks/*.patch`, or regenerate the four patches with `git diff`. I didn't do either, because that's outside the judge stage.","ttft_ms":1903,"type":"result","duration_ms":86351,"uuid":"720f6ddf-5bb4-48c7-bb9f-88cb075a10f5","ttft_stream_ms":1468,"time_to_request_ms":36,"first_content_frame_ms":1468,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
